{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-02",
  "title": "雨中漫步",
  "storyCode": "4-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "392cbd0f50b4bbe7f705d5d6289a32d805117831107683e9471b8a35f408bc0f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "还，还有两个敌人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "他们正向东侧的建筑物逃窜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "我已经瞄准他们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "正中靶心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "噪音，会不会太大了些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "这废城区里爆炸声不断，我想，敌人也不会特别在意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "你通知凯尔希医生了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "在战斗开始前，我就已经通知过凯尔希医生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "整合运动在这片废城中，确实有活动的迹象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "现在还在通话中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "我们是不是更加隐蔽地行动会更好一些？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "刚才的整合运动成员，似乎使用了探知型的法术。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "为了不暴露我们的位置，必须先发制人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "至少，不能让整合运动之间互相联络。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "呼......终于解决了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "霜叶，去看看情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "了解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "通讯器，拿一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "杰西卡，现在还不能懈怠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "这种事情......我还是知道的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "好的，好的，不会再说这些啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "凯尔希医生，听得见吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "一直在听。确实不能懈怠——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "杰西卡，你背后可能有敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "呜哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "怎，怎么会......背后......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "......噫？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "我能从背后攻击你，说明你动作太慢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "暂时没事了，凯尔希医生。我已经解决了敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "你的速度确实好快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "我甚至都没看清楚你是怎么摸过去，又那么快赶回来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "——其实我还没去侦查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "红联系我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "龙门内部的潜藏着的整合运动还没有活动的迹象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "现阶段还是不要打草惊蛇为妙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "顺便，综合其它活跃在废城的侦察小队的信息，藏匿在废城的整合运动的规模，可能远比想象中要大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "也就是说，中奖的反而是我们这边？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "作为侦查小队，还是有一些压力的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "如果这么说的话，到现在为止，我们所消灭的，已经是第二支整合运动小队了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "你能确认我们第一次交火的敌人的身份吗，杰西卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "嗯，应该没错的。我有好好确认过，再让你射击的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......怪我，光顾着计算弹道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "敌人的数量？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "还不清楚具体数字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "霜叶，你那边如何了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "怎么了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "text": "你们去吧，有问题随时反馈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "我们......过去她那里看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "发生了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "......你们没感受到吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "嗯？怎么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "温度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "这么一说......是有点冷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "温度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......的确，和城区外，至少有五度以上的温差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "平白无故天气就变了......怎么会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "抬头看。天气没有变。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "不是天气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "是这里，来，摸一摸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......废墟的墙体？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "是的。这堵墙，在吸收热量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "......怎么会？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "吸温过程，在我们来之前，可能就已经结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "墙体正在回温。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "只是，为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "是什么人，留下了这种痕迹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......在这个地方活动的，就只有整合运动了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "整合运动？他们......怎么做到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "我听别人说过这么一个传说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "——一个，关于雪怪的传说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......真是......令人讨厌的感觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
